@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Root endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### 3. Create a task
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "完成第六课",
  "description": "学习 FastAPI、接口测试与部署"
}

### 4. List tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks

### 5. Get the task created above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}

### 6. Partially update the task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### 7. Send a message to the demo Agent / DeepSeek
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "请用三点解释 RESTful API"
}

### 8. Delete the task (run after the other task requests)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}
